5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I believe we should be cautious about external dependencies. I will examine the quoted delivery windows from suppliers and the winter road closures north of the river.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure everyone can actually get to us! I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I am concerned about the long-term sustainability of our funding. I shall review the county grant terms and the endowment, and the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We often ignore the past. I'll check the two programmes begun six years ago and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I worry about the staff. I will look at the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
