55,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Looking at the candidates, the Digital Archive Portal seems risky due to the supplier windows I found. The Mobile Branch is too vulnerable to roads and costs.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"The Mobile Branch would be amazing for the outer wards, but @George mentioned the budget. Language Learning Circles could work if they are in the community.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,George,,"Language Learning Circles are funded by session fees for a year, which is a risk. However, the Maker Workshop uses the endowment for capital.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,The Digital Archive is just a repeat of the failed digitisation project. Language Learning Circles mirror the successful partner groups I found.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The Maker Workshop is scary because we lost our tool certification person. Language Learning Circles use facilitators, but we still have the supervision gap.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, if Language Learning Circles are coordinated with partner organizations, it reduces our direct operational burden and dependency.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"Exactly! And if they are across the district, it helps the people who can't reach the main branch.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,George,,"If the partners carry the weight, the operating budget impact is minimized. It is more sustainable than a mobile fleet.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,It's the only choice that aligns with the historical success of our partner-run groups.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If the partners provide the trained facilitators, maybe the supervision burden on our staff is lower than a workshop.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,It avoids the supplier delays of the Portal and the road risks of the Mobile Branch. I find it the most reasonable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm happy with this! It brings the library to the people without needing a bus.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,George,,"It is a balanced approach. It utilizes grants without creating a permanent, unsustainable drain on the running lines.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,It's a proven model. I'm fully on board.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel safer with this than the Maker Workshop. I vote for the Circles.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I vote for Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,George,,I vote for Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,May,,I vote for Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
